// Sky Flag Input (1-bit per pattern)
0  // [00] Black - No haze
0  // [01] White - Max haze
0  // [02] Pure Red
0  // [03] Pure Green
0  // [04] Pure Blue
0  // [05] Dark gray
0  // [06] Medium gray
0  // [07] Light gray
0  // [08] Very light gray (same as A)
0  // [09] Mid gray
0  // [10] Light hazy blue-ish
0  // [11] Medium hazy
0  // [12] Slightly hazy
1  // [13] Very hazy - Sky
1  // [14] Hazy sky-like
0  // [15] Dark blue-ish (good contrast)
0  // [16] Brown-ish
0  // [17] Warm tone
0  // [18] Cool tone
0  // [19] Green-ish nature
